⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of Guy Fleegman
node GQT · GQT · ⟦Guy Fleegman:GQT:ccf319⟧

WHO   — Guy Fleegman — the expendable crewman who refuses to die
WHAT  — The redshirt's existential terror, played for both laughs and real feeling: the man certain the plot will kill the nobody.
WHERE — GQT · Galaxy Quest (1999)  Framework inputs: Galaxy Quest (1999, dir. Dean Parisot, DreamWorks); verified cast & facts  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the film loves the throwaway extra enough to give him a soul — and let him live.
HOW   — By panicking that he's expendable, insisting on his own importance, and surviving the story that should have killed him.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  I'm the guy in the episode who dies to show the situation is serious. I'm not gonna die. I'm NOT going to die!

